  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "おんなのこ　から　あずかった　てがみ。\nあてさきは　おとこのこ。\nなぜだか　ふるびた　かんじが　する。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "여자아이가 맡긴 편지.\n받는 이는 남자아이로 되어 있다.\n어째선지 낡아 보인다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "一個女孩子託付的信。\n收信人是男孩子。\n不知為何感覺有點陳舊。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une lettre confiée par une petite fille,\ndont le destinataire est un petit garçon.\nElle semble jaunie par le temps...",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Diesen Brief hast du von einem Mädchen erhalten, um\nihn einem Jungen zu übergeben. Aus irgendeinem\nGrund sieht er schon etwas älter und vergilbt aus.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Carta de aspecto desgastado entregada por una niña y\ncon un chico como destinatario.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una lettera, indirizzata a un bambino, che ha\nl’aria di essere un po’ consumata dal tempo.\nL’hai ricevuta in consegna da una bambina.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A letter entrusted to you by a girl, to be delivered to\na boy. Strangely, it looks old to you.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "女の子　から　預かった　手紙。\n宛先は　男の子。\nなぜだか　古びた　感じが　する。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "女孩子投递的书信\n收件人是男孩子。\n散发出一种怀旧的气息。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Carta de aspecto desgastado entregada por una niña y\ncon un chico como destinatario.",
